    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11962" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cuppēdĭum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cūp-</span></b> ), ii,
			n.
		cuppes, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a tidbit</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 146</span></i>
			Müll.; mostly plur.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cuppēdĭa</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n. (a later form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coppādĭa</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n., <i><span class="en">Apic. 5,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 6</span></i>), <i>dainty dishes, tidbits, delicacies</i> (anteand post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nil moror cuppedia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Stich. 5, 4, 32</span></i>
			; cf. Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 48, 15</span></i> Müll.; cf.
			cuppes, II.</div>
